Package: nemetonsar
Type: Package
Title: Clear-Cut Mapping from Sentinel-1 Time Series over an Area of Interest
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Pascal", "Obstétar", email = "pascal.obstetar@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: Recompute forest clear-cut maps over a user-supplied area of
    interest with the SUFOSAT method (Mermoz et al., 2024,
    <doi:10.1109/JSTARS.2024.3429012>), based on the radar change ratio of
    Sentinel-1 time series (Bouvet et al., 2018, <doi:10.3390/rs10081250>).
    Part of the 'nemeton' family of packages. The package is at the scoping
    stage: see the project brief in the repository.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://github.com/pobsteta/nemetonsar
BugReports: https://github.com/pobsteta/nemetonsar/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Language: fr
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    parallel,
    terra
Suggests:
    covr,
    pkgload,
    rstac,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
